    "regime_notes": "Positive IC and ICIR in all tested regimes: 2020-2022 IC 0.04060/ICIR 0.12170; 2023-2025 0.02860/0.08922; 2026-2027 0.02921/0.09020; 2028-2029 0.03008/0.09424. Small cross-asset universe implies conservative uncertainty interpretation.",
